          "title": "MADE's Taisch: physical AI is a turning point for Italian manufacturing",
          "summary": "The MADE Competence Center president argues humanoid and mobile robots with onboard contextual AI are an epochal shift, with integration and training \u2014 not the technology \u2014 as the real challenge.",
